---
import {Image} from 'astro:assets';
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import {prognoseContent as c} from '../data/prognose-content';
import {pinnacleWave} from '../data/pinnacleai-wave';
import {phone,url} from '../data/site';
import hero from '../assets/prognose-next-step-20261005.png';
import social from '../assets/pinnacleai-prognose-social-20260930.png';
import '../styles/prognose.css';
const page=pinnacleWave.find(p=>p.slug==='prognose')!;
const canonical=url('/prognose');
const graph=[{'@type':'DefinedTerm','@id':canonical+'#module',name:'Prognose',url:canonical,description:c.direct,isPartOf:{'@id':url('/pinnacleai')+'#software'},subjectOf:c.sources.map(s=>url(s.href))}];
---
<PageLayout path="/prognose" label="Prognose" title={page.title} description={page.description} shareImage={social} shareVersion="2026-09-30-pinnacleai-editorial" imageAlt="Prognose · a plan that can change with your child · Pinnacle Blooms Network · 9100 181 181" includeService={false} primaryEntityId={canonical+'#module'} entityGraph={graph} citations={c.sources.map(s=>url(s.href))} faqs={c.faqs} publishedOn="2026-09-30" updatedOn={c.updatedOn} breadcrumbParent={{name:'PinnacleAI®',path:'/pinnacleai'}}>
<div class="prognose-page">
 <section class="prognose-hero prognose-wrap" aria-labelledby="prognose-title">
  <div><p class="prognose-kicker"><Icon name="compass" size={22}/>PinnacleAI® · Prognose</p><h1 id="prognose-title">A clear next step.<br/><em>A plan that can change.</em></h1><p class="prognose-lead">{c.lead}</p><div class="prognose-actions"><a class="prognose-btn prognose-primary" href={phone.href} data-cta="pinnacleai-call"><Icon name="phone"/>Call {phone.display}</a><a class="prognose-btn" href={url('/enroll-autism-speech-aba-therapies-india')} data-cta="final-enquiry">Plan a first conversation <Icon name="arrow"/></a></div><p class="prognose-purpose">{c.purpose}</p><p class="prognose-help">Telephone guidance is free. We’ll explain the suitable professional, centre, first visit and fees before you decide.</p><a class="prognose-text-link" href={url('/centers')}><Icon name="pin" size={20}/>Find a Pinnacle centre →</a></div>
  <figure class="prognose-hero-art"><Image src={hero} widths={[400,640,900,1254]} sizes="(min-width: 1000px) 46vw, (min-width: 700px) 620px, 100vw" format="webp" quality={80} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" alt="Illustrative Pinnacle family and child choosing ball play, with a Prognose pathway from understanding now to a possible next step, support and review."/><figcaption>Understand now. Choose support. Keep learning from the response.</figcaption></figure>
 </section>
 <nav class="prognose-jump prognose-wrap" aria-label="On this page"><a href="#what-it-does"><Icon name="compass" size={18}/>What Prognose does</a><a href="#worked-example"><Icon name="sun" size={18}/>A playground decision</a><a href="#architecture"><Icon name="loop" size={18}/>How planning connects</a><a href="#sources"><Icon name="shield" size={18}/>Licences &amp; evidence</a><a href="#next-step"><Icon name="phone" size={18}/>Begin with Pinnacle</a></nav>
 <section id="what-it-does" class="prognose-section prognose-tint"><div class="prognose-wrap prognose-definition"><div><p class="prognose-kicker">The plain answer</p><h2>A forecast should help you<br/><em>decide what to try next.</em></h2><p>{c.direct}</p><p>Our purpose begins with your child’s life. A useful estimate makes the next decision clearer: <strong>why this goal, why this support and what would change the plan?</strong></p><a class="prognose-text-link" href={url('/verify/evidence/records/bis.html')}>Prognose in the BIS module schedule →</a></div><aside class="prognose-quote"><Icon name="compass" size={34}/><blockquote>A route can be planned.<br/>The next turn still depends on the journey.</blockquote><p>In the same way, a planning estimate gives direction. Your child’s response helps the team decide whether to continue, adapt or take a different route.</p><a href="#worked-example">See the decision change below →</a></aside></div></section>
 <section id="worked-example" class="prognose-section"><div class="prognose-wrap"><div class="prognose-heading"><p class="prognose-kicker">A playground planning example</p><h2>{c.example.title}</h2><p>{c.example.intro}</p></div><ol class="prognose-observations">{c.example.cards.map(o=><li><p class="prognose-kicker">{o.label}</p><Icon name={o.icon} size={30}/><h3>{o.title}</h3><p>{o.text}</p></li>)}</ol><div class="prognose-revision"><span class="prognose-decision-icon"><Icon name="compass" size={38}/></span><div><p class="prognose-kicker">04 · The professional decision changes</p><h3>Keep the life goal. Revise the immediate checkpoint.</h3><p>{c.example.revision}</p></div></div><div class="prognose-checkpoint"><p class="prognose-kicker"><Icon name="clock" size={20}/>The next observation</p><h3>What happened matters more than matching an estimate.</h3><p>{c.example.checkpoint}</p></div><div class="prognose-review-branches">{c.example.branches.map(b=><article><Icon name="loop" size={25}/><h3>{b.title}</h3><p>{b.text}</p></article>)}</div><p class="prognose-source-note">The example explains a planning decision, not instructions for an individual child. <a href={url('/personal-development-kernel')}>See how PDK keeps the context connected →</a></p></div></section>
 <section id="architecture" class="prognose-section prognose-tint"><div class="prognose-wrap"><div class="prognose-heading"><p class="prognose-kicker">Inside PinnacleAI®</p><h2>Look ahead.<br/><em>Build in a way to reconsider.</em></h2><p>A forecast becomes useful when the next observation can change the plan. This diagram explains the module’s place in the care discussion.</p></div><ol class="prognose-architecture">{c.architecture.map((a,i)=><li><span class="prognose-step-number">0{i+1}</span><Icon name={a.icon} size={30}/><h3>{a.title}</h3><p>{a.text}</p><a href={url(a.href)}>Explore this connection →</a></li>)}</ol><div class="prognose-feedback"><Icon name="loop" size={30}/><p><strong>Review returns to the starting assumptions.</strong> Keep what was expected, what happened and what the professional changed visible as separate parts of the discussion.</p></div><details class="prognose-access"><summary>What should we ask about uncertainty?</summary><p>Ask which information supports the estimate, which assumptions may be wrong, and what evidence would change the next step. No individual date for independence, school entry or mainstream inclusion can be promised.</p><a href={url('/verify/evidence/records/external-validation.html')}>Read the current research-status record →</a></details></div></section>
 <section id="pinnacleai-journey" class="prognose-section"><div class="prognose-wrap"><div class="prognose-heading"><p class="prognose-kicker">One child’s life. A connected system.</p><h2>Planning is one part.<br/><em>Participation gives it purpose.</em></h2><p>The forecast connects to measurement, suitable therapies, everyday practice and review. Growing independence and mainstream participation stay in view throughout.</p></div><ol class="prognose-stages">{c.stages.map((s,i)=><li><span>{i+1}</span><Icon name={s.icon} size={27}/><h3>{s.title}</h3><p>{s.text}</p><a href={url(s.href)}>Explore this part →</a></li>)}</ol><p class="prognose-source-note"><a href={url('/pinnacleai')}>Explore PinnacleAI®</a> · <a href={url('/mainstream')}>Mainstream participation</a> · <a href={url('/verify/evidence/pinnacle-paradigm-shift.html')}>The life-first paradigm shift</a></p><h3 class="prognose-therapy-title">The right contribution depends on the goal.</h3><div class="prognose-therapies">{c.therapies.map(t=><a href={url(t.href)}><strong>{t.name}<Icon name="arrow" size={19}/></strong><span>{t.text}</span></a>)}</div><p>We bring relevant expertise into the child’s plan. A diagnosis or a forecast alone does not mean every child needs every therapy.</p></div></section>
 <section id="sources" class="prognose-section prognose-tint"><div class="prognose-wrap"><div class="prognose-heading"><p class="prognose-kicker">Evidence you can inspect</p><h2>A named module.<br/><em>A documented software scope.</em></h2><p>Pinnacle Blooms Network is operated by Bharath Healthcare Laboratories Private Limited. Follow the original records behind the module, intended use and research status.</p></div><div class="prognose-sources">{c.sources.map(s=><article><p class="prognose-kicker">{s.label}</p><h3><Icon name={s.href.includes('records')?'shield':'book'} size={25}/>{s.title}</h3><p>{s.text}</p><p class="prognose-source-detail">{s.detail}</p><a href={url(s.href)}>Inspect the source →</a></article>)}</div><div class="prognose-actions prognose-source-downloads"><a href="/pinnacle-pages-data/prognose-sources.json">Source map · JSON</a><a href="/pinnacle-pages-data/prognose-sources.txt">Plain text</a><a href="/pinnacle-pages-data/prognose-reading.md">Markdown reading aid</a><a href={url('/verify/evidence/cite.html')}>Citation library</a><a href={'https://wa.me/?text='+encodeURIComponent('How PinnacleAI Prognose connects a possible next step with professional review: '+canonical)}>Share on WhatsApp</a></div></div></section>
 <section id="questions" class="prognose-section"><div class="prognose-wrap prognose-faq-layout"><div><p class="prognose-kicker">Before you decide</p><h2>Clarity for your family.<br/><em>Room for your questions.</em></h2><p>You should understand the next goal and why it matters without becoming a technology expert.</p></div><div class="prognose-faq">{c.faqs.map(f=><details><summary>{f.question}</summary><p>{f.answer}</p></details>)}</div></div></section>
 <section id="next-step" class="prognose-close"><div class="prognose-wrap"><p class="prognose-kicker">Every Child Counts®</p><h2>What would make your child’s<br/>next everyday moment easier?</h2><p>Tell us one activity your child enjoys, what changes across settings and what you hope to make easier. Let’s begin with a conversation your family can understand and help shape.</p><ul><li><Icon name="heart"/>Start with what matters to your child.</li><li><Icon name="people"/>Discuss a suitable professional and centre.</li><li><Icon name="compass"/>Understand the visit and fees before you choose.</li></ul><div class="prognose-actions"><a class="prognose-btn prognose-primary" href={phone.href} data-cta="pinnacleai-close-call"><Icon name="phone"/>Call {phone.display}</a><a class="prognose-btn" href={url('/enroll-autism-speech-aba-therapies-india')} data-cta="final-enquiry">Plan a first conversation <Icon name="arrow"/></a><a class="prognose-text-link" href={url('/centers')}>Find a centre →</a></div><p class="prognose-help">Telephone guidance is free. Suitable care and individual progress depend on your child’s needs and professional review.</p></div></section>
</div>
</PageLayout>
